## Themes

Stored under `themes/`, loaded via `frontend.themes` in `configuration.yaml`.

| Name | Notes |
| --- | --- |
| Frosted Glass Auto | follows system light/dark |
| Frosted Glass Dark | dark only |
| Frosted Glass Light | light only |

## Supporting integrations

- **Music Assistant** — wires media player cards
- **alert** — surfaces system alerts directly on the dashboard
